== Quest Start ==
Talk to Josin Faithbringer in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Josin Faithbringer'
:''Josin Faithbringer says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Are you ready to begin your [test of faith]?' ''
You say, 'test of faith'
:''Josin Faithbringer says, 'I have faith that you will do well.  Choose the test, and I shall tell you what I require from you.  I offer tests in [courage], [skill], and [protection], along with [resolution], [theurgy], and helping the [weak].' ''

== Cleric Test of Courage ==

You say, 'courage'
:''Josin Faithbringer says, 'You have come seeking the knowledge and treasures I possess.  I will impart such things to you, if you do a service to your god.  It matters not who that god may be, but the service and the faith you must exemplify.  Bring to me a silver hoop and a wind rune lena.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Truewind Earring}}

